                                  <p class=\"item-date mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-date\" mbr-if=\"showDate\">\n                                                26.09.2030\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"item-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-text, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                                                Community Impact Day:\n                                                <span>Beyond business, our agency is dedicated to making a positive\n                                                    impact on the community.</span>\n                                            </p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                        <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                            Read More\n                                        </a>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'px', 'margin-right': gap + 'px'}\">\n                                <div class=\"slide-content\">\n                                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                        <div class=\"item-img\">\n                                            <img src=\"@SITES@/2098721/assets/images/hb9a0329.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"7\" data-bs-slide-to=\"7\">\n                                            <div class=\"title-wrap\">\n                                                <h4 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .title-wrap\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                                                    Ceremony\n                                                </h4>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\n                                            <p class=\"item-date mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-date\" mbr-if=\"showDate\">\n                                                30.09.2030\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"item-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-text, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                                                Mavericks Awards Ceremony:\n                                                <span>The Digital Mavericks Awards recognize and celebrate individuals who\n                                                have made a significant impact.</span>\n                                            </p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                        <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                            Read More\n                                        </a>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"embla__button embla__button--prev\">\n                        <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-left mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"embla__button embla__button--next\">\n                        <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-right mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
